You are light on your feet, handling your armour better. Each step you take regenerates [0.20, 0.40, 0.60, 0.80, 1.00 (TL1-5)] stamina, and your fatigue is permanently reduced by [0.9%, 2.7%, 4.1%, 5.2%, 6.2% (TL1-5)].

At level 3 you are able to walk so lightly that you never trigger traps that require pressure.
